sequenceDiagram
  participant B as Owner browser
  participant G as Vercel protection
  participant S as server.mjs
  participant A as Owner gate
  participant D as Neon
  B->>G: POST /api/tasks (status change, expected version)
  G->>S: authenticated request
  S->>A: verify owner and Origin
  A-->>S: owner principal
  S->>D: transaction with row lock
  alt version matches
    D-->>S: commit
    S-->>B: 200 new version
  else stale version
    D-->>S: no change
    S-->>B: 409 conflict
  end
  B->>S: refetch GET /api/tasks (every 30 s and after save)
